{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Because of</b> — He acknowledges that the enemy's hand has prevailed over him, because of His wrath." "<b>For You have lifted me up</b> — In the manner of: \"You have cast from heavens to earth the glory of Israel\" [Lamentations 2:1]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 102, :notes {0 "Resolved זעמתו as 'His wrath' (divine); could conceivably read 'my wrath' if the suffix were first person, but context supports the third-person divine referent."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:47.965369091Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}